# SmartRoute AI — Architecture Diagram
# Render with: https://mermaid.live or any Mermaid renderer

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Entry["入口层 (React 19 + Vite)"]
        Search["搜索页"]
        XiaoTuan["问小团"]
