    Router --> Parser
    Parser --> Retriever & AMap
    Retriever --> VectorStore
    Planner --> BuilderSvc
    BuilderSvc --> AMap
    API --> Services
    ProfileSvc --> UserDB
    AnchorSvc --> AMap
    Parser --> DeepSeek
    AMap --> AMapAPI
    TraceSvc --> DeepSeek
    Planner --> InsightSvc
    AdjustAPI --> AdjustSvc
    AdjustSvc --> TraceSvc
    ProfileSvc --> ProfileSvc
    Config -.-> AMap & DeepSeek

